0,15} with N=2) duplicates the N=2 column of the Tiered Matrix. How should we handle Test 3 vs. the Matrix?"},{"is_multi_select":false,"options":["(Recommended) Record the failure in the metrics (Pass Ratio < 100%) AND auto-clean orphaned verify-* clones/networks between tiers so the benchmark continues cleanly","Abort the tier immediately on any 500 error and mark the entire tier as failed"],"question":"At M=15, Incus/OVN hit a real limit (\"Insufficient dynamic addresses allocated\"), leaving an orphan clone that polluted the next tier. How should benchmark_suite.py handle tier errors?"}],"toolAction":"Asking questions on benchmark plan and staged execution","toolSummary":"Ask questions for benchmark plan"}}]}
